 "description": "0-100 rug-risk score for any Solana token: mint/freeze authority, Token-2022 traps, holder concentration, liquidity depth \u2014 plus pump.fun curve flags. Contract state is read live from Solana (authorities, Token-2022 extensions such as transfer fees, hooks, permanent delegate, pausable), holders from the largest accounts, market from DexScreener. For pump.fun mints the curve forensics flags are merged in. When to use: For any Solana token, pump.fun or not. For pump.fun curve-stage detail use pump_token (on the MAD Synapse \u00b7 Pump & LP server, https://agent.maddegen.art/hub/mcp/pump); for EVM tokens use evm_token_security. Price: $0.005 per call (10 free/day; after that a payment-required result lists x402 options). Errors: returns isError with a message for invalid input or an upstream failure (not charged).",
